{
  "_comment": [
    "Firebase: Hosting + Storage for delivery only. No Firestore.",
    "Accounts + seafood domain live in PostgreSQL (local Docker or Cloud SQL).",
    "SQL Connect Cloud SQL: sukaseafood-654b7-instance (us-east4) — Blaze trial.",
    "Schema contract: Database Schema V3 (seafood_item hub).",
    "Schema source of truth: backend/db/schema/v3_*.sql (apply.sh).",
    "GraphQL mirror: dataconnect/schema/schema.gql (COMPATIBLE validation).",
    "",
    "Two Hosting sites so Iteration 2 cannot overwrite Iteration 1:",
    "  live → https://sukaseafood-654b7.web.app  (working; deploy hosting:live)",
    "  i1   → https://sukaseafood-i1.web.app     (frozen I1; never deploy I2 here)",
    "Web talks to same-origin /api/v1; each site rewrites to its own Cloud Run.",
    "Deploy web: flutter build web --release (frontend/) then firebase deploy --only hosting:live"
  ],
  "hosting": [
    {
      "target": "live",
      "public": "frontend/build/web",
      "ignore": [
        "firebase.json",
        "**/.*",
        "**/node_modules/**"
      ],
      "rewrites": [
        {
          "source": "/api/**",
          "run": {
            "serviceId": "sukaseafood-api",
            "region": "asia-southeast1"
          }
        },
        {
          "source": "**",
          "destination": "/index.html"
        }
      ],
      "headers": [
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(js|css|woff2)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/index.html",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/flutter_service_worker.js",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/flutter_bootstrap.js",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/flutter.js",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/main.dart.js",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "i1",
      "public": "frontend/build/web",
      "ignore": [
        "firebase.json",
        "**/.*",
        "**/node_modules/**"
      ],
      "rewrites": [
        {
          "source": "/api/**",
          "run": {
            "serviceId": "sukaseafood-api-i1",
            "region": "asia-southeast1"
          }
        },
        {
          "source": "**",
          "destination": "/index.html"
        }
      ],
      "headers": [
        {
          "source": "**/*.@(js|css|woff2)",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/index.html",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/flutter_service_worker.js",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/flutter_bootstrap.js",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/flutter.js",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source": "/main.dart.js",
          "headers": [
            {
              "key": "Cache-Control",
              "value": "no-cache"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "storage": {
    "rules": "storage.rules"
  },
  "emulators": {
    "dataconnect": {
      "dataDir": "dataconnect/.dataconnect/pgliteData"
    }
  },
  "dataconnect": {
    "source": "dataconnect"
  }
}
